#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:27
#: 848294c448264b26af3507c58f3b6b4b
msgid ""
"The amount of rudder input into the differential spoilers is controlled by "
":ref:`DSPOILR_RUD_RATE<DSPOILR_RUD_RATE>`. A value of 0, totally disables "
"this feature. The default is 100(%). Conventional planes and gliders will "
"probably want to change this."
msgstr ""
"方向舵输入对差动扰流板的影响程度由 :ref:`DSPOILR_RUD_RATE<DSPOILR_RUD_RATE>` 控制。值为 0 "
"时完全禁用该功能。默认值为 100（%）。传统固定翼和滑翔机可能需要更改此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:30
#: 8f3165cebe5143ef937b69695979aee4
msgid "Gliders"
msgstr "滑翔机"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:32
#: fac2520334214e2c80cd506adcbe22f1
msgid ""
"Gliders can utilize differential spoilers to implement flaperon style "
"functions but with the option of ``crow`` brakes. Crow operation is shown "
"below, where the inner and outer spoiler panels on a wing side are moved in "
"opposite directions to implement the crow brake, but move together as "
"aileron panels. The inner panel can be extended further than the outer to "
"provide flap effect. This allows aileron, flap, and crow action to be "
"implemented from the two control surfaces on each side of the wing."
msgstr ""
"滑翔机可利用差动扰流板实现襟副翼风格的功能，并具有 ``crow`` 制动选项。Crow 操作如下图所示：机翼一侧的内外扰流板向相反方向移动以实现 "
"crow 制动，但作为副翼面板时则同向移动。内侧面板可比外侧面板延伸更多，以提供襟翼效果。这使得机翼两侧各两个控制面能够实现副翼、襟翼和 crow "
"制动功能。"

