#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:63
#: 07a1637a63eb4dceb74018b00743594b
msgid ""
"You can adjust the direction of each servo using the SERVOn_REVERSED "
"parameters, and swap channels to get the right movement direction for "
"elevons and rudder. Flap operation is also possible. The weighting of flap "
"input to the movement of the outer and inner control surfaces can be set "
"using :ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W1 <DSPOILER_CROW_W1>` and :ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W2 "
"<DSPOILER_CROW_W2>` respectively. The default value of \"0\" for each "
"parameter is no flap action."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 SERVOn_REVERSED "
"参数调整每个舵机的方向，并通过交换通道来获得升降副翼和方向舵的正确运动方向。襟翼操作也是可行的。襟翼输入对外侧和内侧控制面运动的加权可分别通过 "
":ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W1 <DSPOILER_CROW_W1>` 和 :ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W2 "
"<DSPOILER_CROW_W2>` 设置。每个参数的默认值「0」表示无襟翼动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:68
#: 02fe791c70944d6e88918a8c20e16d90
msgid ""
"manual flap control is controlled by any RC channel whose ``RCx_OPTION`` is "
"set to \"208\"."
msgstr "手动襟翼控制由 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为「208」的任意 RC 通道控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:71
#: ee987a78c831490c8fe293b6b916385b
msgid "Differential Spoiler options"
msgstr "差动扰流板选项"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:72
#: 71792335765c4fd3a7b4873a2309405a
msgid ""
":ref:`DSPOILER_OPTS <DSPOILER_OPTS>` parameter gives several options that "
"can be used to tailor the dspoiler functionality to your aircraft. They can "
"be used to setup a 'full house' wing on a glider. "
":ref:`DSPOILER_OPTS<DSPOILER_OPTS>` is a bit-mask each, bit enables "
"different functionality."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DSPOILER_OPTS <DSPOILER_OPTS>` "
"参数提供了多个选项，可用于根据您的飞机定制差动扰流板功能。它们可用于在滑翔机上设置「全翼」控制。:ref:`DSPOILER_OPTS<DSPOILER_OPTS>`"
" 是一个位掩码，每一位启用不同的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:77
#: 0247899b283944d5a26400b75c1fd0be
msgid "**Bit**"
msgstr "**位**"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:79
#: dd45a829de5c43ff9404105f0baeeef5
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:79
#: 71fbfc511ebd44a2aa166e74c3578112
msgid ""
"Pitch control, this bit enables or disables pitch control output using the "
"differential spoilers. 1 uses elevons as source for use with a flying wing, "
"0 uses ailerons as source for use with a traditional plane"
msgstr "俯仰控制，该位启用或禁用通过差动扰流板的俯仰控制输出。1 使用升降副翼作为来源（适用于飞翼），0 使用副翼作为来源（适用于传统固定翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:83
#: acc6e7835ed74fd49cca6947537b74fd
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:83
#: 35f54d4e443e44de8cb4b35f1d176624
msgid ""
"Full span ailerons, 1 uses both the inner and outer control surfaces for "
"roll control 0 just used the outer control surfaces"
msgstr "全展副翼，1 使用内外控制面共同进行横滚控制，0 仅使用外侧控制面"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:86
#: ef27318acef74ab28ae0b9683f80e71b
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:86
#: 84c7afe56f534fdda36338c45f5c5102
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Progressive crow, 0 gives crow brakes - the inner control surfaces are moved"
" down and the outer surfaces moved up at the same time 1, for 0 to 50% flap "
"only the inner surfaces are moved down then from 50% to 100% flap the outer "
"surfaces are moved up, this gives traditional flaps first then crow brakes"
msgstr ""
"渐进式 crow 制动，0 为 crow 制动模式——内侧控制面向下移动的同时外侧控制面向上移动；1 为在 0 到 50% "
"襟翼时仅内侧控制面向下移动，然后在 50% 到 100% 襟翼时外侧控制面向上移动，这样先实现传统襟翼效果再实现 crow 制动"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:92
#: 10462a98027d4433bd82f206df600298
msgid ""
"Defaults are bit 0 and bit 1 set to 1. **Conventional planes and gliders "
"will probably want to change bit 0 to \"0\".**"
msgstr "默认值为第 0 位和第 1 位设置为 1。**传统固定翼和滑翔机可能需要将第 0 位改为「0」。**"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:94
#: e76f9271f60f42d1a150c51e5a6def42
msgid ""
":ref:`DSPOILER_AILMTCH <DSPOILER_AILMTCH>` allows the downwards travel of "
"the inner surfaces to be limited to a percentage of their full downwards "
"travel. This only affects the travel when the control surfaces are used as "
"full span ailerons or for differential yaw. Using this parameter a flap "
"control surface with lots of downwards travel can still be utilized for full"
" span ailerons. Upwards travel of the control surfaces is unaffected."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DSPOILER_AILMTCH <DSPOILER_AILMTCH>` "
"允许将内侧控制面向下的行程限制为其完整向下行程的一定百分比。这仅影响控制面用作全展副翼或差动偏航时的行程。通过此参数，向下行程较大的襟翼控制面仍可用于全展副翼。控制面向上的行程不受影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:106
#: 439756e840d54681957bcf106d3083c1
msgid "Crow Mode Switch"
msgstr "Crow 模式开关"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:108
#: 2d3e1a122c61426e81930e8f49ba6a46
msgid ""
"If Differential Spoilers are used, setting an ``RCx_OPTION`` channel to "
"\"87\" will allow the control of CROW aileron (outer spoilers) operation."
msgstr "若使用差动扰流板，将 ``RCx_OPTION`` 通道设置为「87」可控制 CROW 副翼（外侧扰流板）操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:110
#: b7935e84bc754270ae4c31ef5f57592e
msgid ""
"HIGH position: No change to CROW deflection amount or use of progressive "
"crow."
msgstr "HIGH 位置：不改变 CROW 偏转量或渐进式 crow 的使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:111
#: 00a78f3a13b34d34b1db65c51cd5e938
msgid ""
"MIDDLE position: force progressive crow, assuming "
":ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W1<DSPOILER_CROW_W1>` is non-zero, even if "
":ref:`DSPOILER_OPTS <DSPOILER_OPTS>` bit 2 is zero."
msgstr ""
"MIDDLE 位置：强制使用渐进式 crow，假设 :ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W1<DSPOILER_CROW_W1>` 非零，即使 "
":ref:`DSPOILER_OPTS <DSPOILER_OPTS>` 第 2 位为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:112
#: 5600542a2b6f4972a89e716c7f3e2609
msgid ""
"LOW position: effectively sets :ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W1<DSPOILER_CROW_W1>` to "
"zero. Only inner spoilers move with FLAP channel, ie normal flaps."
msgstr ""
"LOW 位置：有效地将 :ref:`DSPOILER_CROW_W1<DSPOILER_CROW_W1>` 设为零。仅内侧扰流板随 FLAP "
"通道移动，即普通襟翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/differential-spoilers.rst:114
#: c0f3e3771b1946398334f1fbbb830679
msgid ""
"This allows live changes to CROW operation on approaches so that speed "
"braking and descent rates can be changed during the approach."
msgstr "这允许在进近过程中实时更改 CROW 操作，从而可以在进近过程中更改减速制动和下降率。"
